abstract: >
  FSM-Bench-20 is a reproducible benchmark of 20 natural-language requirement
  specifications for evaluating open-weight LLMs on guarded finite-state machine
  generation under local Ollama inference. The artifact includes the dataset,
  prompt specification, FSM JSON schema, evaluation scripts with conservative
  guard-aware determinism (M0–M3), and a completed 140-run campaign freeze
  (manifest 20260602T195520Z) with nested rates G1 98.6%, G2 78.6%, M0 31.4%,
  and M1 33.6%.
